mments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Kickoff: executing epic 0e68-41eb (REB-2658) Many-to-many tracker projects. Worktree ../reb-2658-m2m-projects on branch reb-2658-m2m-projects from origin/main d2dea317ec. Landing method: rebar/Gerrit default (push gerrit HEAD:refs/for/main, stacked relation chain, LLM-Review+1 AND Verified+1 per change). Both gates ON (plan-review claim + completion-verifier close). Tree: 12 stories, all open, 3 blockers all closed. Stack order (topological): L0 c927,4631,67f9,a33c,ce02,273a; L1 cef7,462d; L2 1734,d19d; L3 7032 docs; L4 368f live rehearsal.","timestamp":1786645927659458001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Unblocked: repointed this worktree's .tickets-tracker symlink to a private local clone of origin/tickets at /Users/joeoakhart/reb-2658-tracker (env b8a354e0, same opcert identity, own write lock), bypassing the wedged shared-store compaction lock (PID 57999). Resuming epic 0e68 execution normally; auto-push targets origin/tickets.","timestamp":1786647427117308001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"1252-db50-8a8f-43b5","timestamp":1786648028597722001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"1252-db50-8a8f-43b5","timestamp":1786648582965901001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"c927 committed (c9ff59abe6, Change-Id I9bd840e4) and pushed to Gerrit change 1736: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1736 . Root-caused prior commit failure: pre-commit hook needs the venv-activated PATH (system ruff 0.15.6 emits false BLE001 failures and mypy is absent; pinned .venv ruff 0.16.1 + mypy 2.3.0 pass clean). Also rewrote subject to satisfy 50/72. Awaiting LLM-Review +1 / Verified +1.","timestamp":1786649826500083001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"SURVEY: epic REB-2658 was driven by stopped session 6f8df6b5 (operator epic-wide stop order). Only 4631 had completed handoff work (impl at 39c93ea3dc in worktree lamprey-libwrites, verified byte-identical). Other 10 stories (67f9,a33c,ce02,273a,cef7,462d,1734,d19d,7032,368f) are fresh/open, no prior work. Epic itself in_progress (stale claim, same assignee). REUSED 4631: fresh review-plan PASS in my env (key b8a354e0), claimed, cherry-picked 39c93ea3dc onto c927, rebased whole stack onto latest origin/main 2af5a4c773 (fixed transient _config_schema 808->677 over-cap on old base). Gates green (lint/typecheck/size 4/4; 116 affected-area tests pass). Pushed stack: change 1736 (c927 patchset2) + 1737 (4631 new). Awaiting votes. Next: fresh held-out TDD for L0 remainder starting ce02/67f9.","timestamp":1786650525625829001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"c927 CI FIX: Verified-1 root cause was stale generated docs (docs/cli-reference.md + docs/mcp-reference.md) — bridge projects added CLI+MCP surface. Regenerated via scripts/gen_cli_reference.py + gen_mcp_reference.py, folded into c927 via fixup+autosquash (Change-Id preserved), re-pushed 1736/1737. LESSON: run all 4 gen_*.py in pre-flight for CLI/MCP/env/ADR changes. ce02 DONE: fresh review-plan PASS (1 advisory E6 honored), claimed, extracted STATUS cluster to reducer/_processors_status.py (777->623, new 174; both <=650), byte-identical move + re-export, oracle 5/5 + 50 reducer tests green + teeth-checked, lint/typecheck green. Pushed change 1738 (stacked). Stack now: 1736 c927 / 1737 4631 / 1738 ce02.","timestamp":1786651634172986001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"a33c: extracted ACLI pagination cluster (_ACLI_CEILING, SilentTruncationError, _extract_issues, _iter_pages, collect) from fetcher.py (771->602) into new fetch_paging.py (190). Byte-identical motion, re-export in fetcher, one-way. Oracle test_fetch_paging_split.py (5 tests, teeth-checked via ceiling mutation->RED). 42 existing pagination/fetch tests + 2642 reconciler unit green (1 known pre-existing ref_lock git-2.55 flake). lint/typecheck/docs clean. Committed 96bf141a3c, pushed Gerrit change 1742 (stacked on ce02/1738).","timestamp":1786653034869943001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"CI triage: c927 (1736) Verified-1 root cause on ps3 was NOT docs (that was fixed) but tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_output_schema_coverage.py — new MCP tools bridge_projects_{set,remove} advertise WriteAckOut outputSchema and bridge_projects_list returns plain dict, none classified. Fixed: set/remove -> EXEMPT_GENERIC, list -> NO_SCHEMA_EXEMPT. 36/36 coverage tests pass. Folded into c927 via fixup+autosquash (Change-Ids preserved), re-pushed whole stack 1736/1737/1738/1742 (updated:4).","timestamp":1786653269693897001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"273a DISPOSITION = OBSOLETE (not implementing). Superseded by closed 744a which already graduated dispatch_one.py off the size gate (886->673 LOC via dispatch_apply_phases.py extraction). 273a plan is stale (targets lines 432-796 + locally-defined _update_one_dispatch_links; current file ends 673, that symbol now in dispatch_apply_phases:546). review-plan BLOCK P4 oversize (9895>8000) AND overlap: duplicates 744a (0.82). Dependent d19d records file_impact=dispatch_one.py (edits update_one in place), needs no dispatch_update.py seam. Actions: commented obsolete evidence on 273a; linked 273a duplicates 744a; commented + UNLINKED d19d depends_on 273a (d19d now blocked only by cef7). Clean close impossible (no certified plan-review attestation; work superseded not done) -> needs operator force-close. Left 273a open with durable trail; surfacing in final report. Proceeding to 67f9.","timestamp":1786653738695176001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"67f9: review-plan PASS (signed, no findings); claimed; authored tests/unit/test_store_compat_multi_project.py (6 tests) RED-first (2 happy-path RED: multi-project-bridge unregistered); one-line change registered multi-project-bridge in KNOWN_CAPABILITIES; GREEN + teeth-check (wrong name -> RED); lint+typecheck clean; committed 5276dec1b8 (Change-Id I16ce4b0), pushed -> change 1744 stacked on a33c/1742.","timestamp":1786654172613546001}],"created_at":1786645904757646001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"e2c3e64b-1eb4-4da9-b42a-c1b637b9d54d","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"0e68-41eb-5782-4336"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","0e68-41eb-5782-4336"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"1252-db50-8a8f-43b5","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Implement REB-2658 (epic 0e68-41eb): Many-to-many tracker projects","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a46a9ae1-e455-4836-ad15-f0f09ee8643e","e2c3e64b-1eb4-4da9-b42a-c1b637b9d54d","4547ba33-fd9b-43a1-be6f-ed90ac2afa2b","2aa060e4-b286-4a67-b738-fefbd41c2710","6fad713d-0c52-4202-96b0-7f82573d0d0c","619905df-649c-44e4-a905-376c44db062e","8e7d3935-f83c-49af-b57a-5b5e2cd208ae","6d407cda-c310-4367-b666-91d2f401e90d","90ba3b4e-56b6-4ed4-ab54-8805ebc4de3b","3baf67e7-11e8-437c-87d6-36001a5a7140","be454c6e-210a-4bd5-ab8e-869725064f11","9720153a-3a28-459e-aed3-be2727754317","364639ed-e7b1-4ac5-8